# Photo originals must never land in the repo: git keeps every version of every
# file forever, so a committed 30MB scan stays in history even if you delete it
# later. Run tools/add-photos.sh instead — it writes the web-sized .jpg files
# into files/photos/, and those DO get committed.
*.tif
*.tiff
*.TIF
*.TIFF
*.raw
*.RAW
*.arw
*.ARW
*.cr2
*.CR2
*.nef
*.NEF
*.dng
*.DNG
*.psd
*.PSD
